    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bc6\u0bc6\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Speaker) \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dcf\u0db8\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dba\u0db1\u0dca \u0d85\u0dbb\u0dca\u0da0\u0dca\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dcf \u0db8\u0dc0\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dc0\u0dcf. You present your written matter of Privilege now.\n\n\u0dc0\u0dbb\u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0dba: \u0d86\u0dbb\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dc2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0da7 \u0dad\u0dbb\u0dca\u0da2\u0dcf \u0d91\u0dbd\u0dca\u0dbd \u0dc0\u0dd3\u0db8\u0dc0 \u0bc6\u0bbf\u0bb1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bbf\u0bae\u0bc8 : \u0bc6\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba4\u0bc1\u0b95\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b85\u0b9a\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0bc1\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bb2\u0bcd\n\nPRIVILEGE: THREAT TO SECURITY\n\nI, Dr. Ramanathan Archchuna, Member of Parliament and the Leader of Independent Group 17, being the sole Representative of my party in Parliament, wrote to you formally to request for an opportunity to raise a Privilege issue in the House on 22nd February, 2025 regarding a serious incident that poses a direct threat to my safety and security.\n\nOn the night of 12th February, 2025, approximately at 10.25 p.m. while being in Valampuri Hotel, I was physically assaulted by two known individuals. In the same incident, my personal legal secretary, Miss Kowshalya Narendran, was also attacked. Immediately following the attack, I reported the matter to the police via the Emergency Hotline 119 and personally lodged a complaint at the Jaffna Police Station. The police conducted an inquiry, leading to the arrest of the suspects. However, in an unexpected turn of events, a case was filed against me for self-defence, which was wrongly interpreted by the authorities. Subsequently, complaints from both sides were withdrawn.\n\n1391 1392\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dda\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\n\nThis incident is of grave concern as it directly impacts on my right to function as a Member of Parliament without fear for my life. As you are well aware, the recent murder of Mr. Ganemulle Sanjeewa within the courts and the continuous killings that have occurred in the past week have heightened my concern regarding every Member\u2019s personal security, including mine. Given the current security situation and the threat I have experienced, I respectfully urged you to allow me to raise this Privilege issue in Parliament on 22nd February, 2025 and I thank you for the opportunity given at least after three days."
  },
