    "chunk_size_bytes": 2126,
    "chunk_text": "There is not a word from the Government! So, without tackling this question of dairy production in the areas of Mayilathamadu and Madhavanai, Sir, this becomes meaningless for the people of the Eastern Province.\n\nproblem. Now, this Government talks of continuing and bringing that irrigation project to fruition without addressing those sinister colonization schemes of the previous Governments. This sends shivers down our spine, Sir, and the Government must have answers to that issue. Then, when the Lower Malwathu Oya Irrigation Project completes, actually, the ones who are affected are 15 Muslim families because their areas are low-lying and get flooded. But, the previous Governments had identified 1,500 families from the Anuradhapura District as the affected! This Lower Malwathu Oya Irrigation Project is carried out in Mannar District. My good Colleague, the Hon. SelvamAdaikkalanathan is from that district and it is actually carried out in Mannar District. But, 1,500 families have been identified from the Anuradhapura District saying that they are affected by this project and that they are going to be relocated. Where are they going to be resettled? They are going to be resettled in Chettikulam in the Vavuniya District.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0db4\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bc6\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bcd \u0bc6\u0bc6\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Speaker) Hon. Ponnambalam, could you please wind up now? You have exhausted even the two minutes over your two minutes.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0da2\u0dd3.\u0da2\u0dd3. \u0db4\u0db4\u0ddc\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbd\u0db8\u0dca \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bc7\u0bc0.\u0bc7\u0bc0. \u0ba4\u0bc6\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0ba9\u0bae\u0bcd\u0bc6\u0bb2\u0bae\u0bcd) (The Hon. G.G. Ponnambalam) I am finishing up, Sir.\n\nSo, all of these schemes, Sir, are actually quite worrisome. Unless this Government comes up with very clear, unambiguous positions on the matters we have raised, this Budget goes the same way as the previous ones did. The policies of this Government are no different to the policies of the Governments we had opposed, whose Budgets we had opposed."
  },
