    "chunk_text": "\" 2. Fast-Tracking Investigations and Indictments - Ensuring prompt investigation and filing of indictments in major crimes that have shocked the public, such as the murder of Dinesh Shafter, the masterminds behind the Easter Sunday attacks and the recent underworld-related shootings.\"\n\nSir, I mentioned this earlier also, that it has been ten years since the Central Bank Bond scam happened; the murder of Dinesh Shafter was in 2022 and the Easter Sunday attacks was in 2019."
